{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_title", "source_sha256": "1fad915b7ff1c29c9c4ff4f8006300937c7c8c4e82db5ae49323ff35d22e3825", "ja": "13thLIVE 全力援走 留守電", "zh": "13thLIVE 全力援走 留言电话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6fa5022334a34893acc1874a09dce3eeec899ff775cd4b358e5d0b69912a4ea1", "ja": "13thLIVE DAY1\n全力援走を無事に終えた\n紗代子からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "13thLIVE DAY1\n全力援走顺利结束后，\n纱代子留下的语音留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "ad39bccbccaae8c804c8b7c6e618b69b961b610fd59480d2ec5e8242e97c6471", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です、紗代子です！\nあの、勝手に留守電入れちゃってごめんなさい！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了，我是纱代子！\n那个，没经过允许就给您留了语音，真的很抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "4f1a3919fe87ce9453fd47276a6894799bfe4e3b67655e9625e560c9f32db05d", "ja": "今、はじけそうなほど胸がいっぱいで、\nすぐに話したくて！　電話しちゃいました！", "zh": "现在心里满满的，简直快要迸发出来了，\n所以想马上告诉您！就直接打电话过来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "a3192e826867e9feff2cdd3cfbc085eec7a23835bc4b53407b617e08fb769012", "ja": "今日の主演公演、タイトルは『全力援走』で……。\n私は今日、ちゃんと全力を出し切れました！", "zh": "今天的主演公演，标题是《全力援走》……\n我今天，确确实实拼尽全力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "c2f6d30bbce65cd8c8288198dd864a33be8b6d0f9771d4c3597396daf72523ef", "ja": "正直ここに来るまでは、たまにくじけそうに\nなったりもしましたけど……。", "zh": "说实话，在来到这里之前，我也有过几次差点撑不下去的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "8cd99d05bb90845a8df8452e55280d42035858188641977f29b34377fd8dfc8e", "ja": "でも、いつも劇場のみんなが助けてくれたり、\n{$P$}が背中を押してくれて……。", "zh": "但是，剧场里的大家总是会帮助我，{$P$}也一直在背后支持我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "0fae84d2272723eba60dd3566093f94cb02c3c5b071cf291c17f7562b9784bad", "ja": "そんな周りの人たちのおかげで、\n私は今日にたどりつけたんだと思います！", "zh": "我想，正是多亏了身边的大家，我才能走到今天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "1568e483301b1c04dc42cd14f46eec01222d65fc629bdb52d0307c3253f4eb9d", "ja": "みんなにはさっき、お礼を言えました。\nでも{$P$}には言えてなくて。", "zh": "刚才已经向大家道过谢了。\n但是，还没能向{$P$}道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "4d4c5c4838b646c6f74489cd8e85886ba041cd2c28f1f67d07b82a750b56b8c1", "ja": "もう我慢できなくて、それで電話しちゃいました。\n直接じゃなくてごめんなさい。でも、言います！", "zh": "我已经忍不住了，所以就打电话过来了。  \n没能当面说，对不起。不过，我要说了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "a7c4894148df39781129bd23459f8a30dfd0ac65939b2e88f0455271a40f18b0", "ja": "{$P$}。私がダメでもあきらめないで\nずっと支えてくれて、ずっとずっと見守ってくれて。", "zh": "{$P$}。就算我不行，也请不要放弃\n一直支持着我，一直一直守望着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "71af94913de514be40442909b6cf5c736be3cc63621ab920cbe1c690c3724395", "ja": "本当に、本当に……、\nありがとうございましたーーーーっ！！", "zh": "真的、真的……，\n非常感谢您————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "765f34454cf61e0dd2198cd82e7386fff67993ad1262c0282b81840cebb14ade", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……はぁ……、\nふうううう～～～～……。", "zh": "哈……哈……哈……  \n呼呜呜呜呜～～～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "d634e66f9f4a206f5179779f294c515dc6ab1d072857b153fa6f1f75361d64f1", "ja": "あ、ごめんなさいっ！　言いたいことが言えたから、\nなんだか、完全燃焼しちゃいました……。", "zh": "啊，对不起！因为把想说的话都说出来了，\n不知不觉就感觉整个人都燃尽了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "925c9ea1d7d96adcb6a579a30e091ca8e4b8ca2016e10e63612c1f70ee39509e", "ja": "でも、明日は千鶴さんの主演公演だし、\nそんな、燃え尽きてる場合じゃないですよね！？", "zh": "不过，明天可是千鹤小姐主演的公演，哪有时间这样燃尽啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "b20db3447ff045078f4c6e5ff1f56937c77145ae7aea45c1f5ed65a01fb139a6", "ja": "今日はゆっくり休んで、明日に備えてください！\n私も今から休んで、明日、全力で応援します！！", "zh": "今天请好好休息，为明天做好准备！\n我也要从现在开始休息，明天会全力为您加油！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "d544b4430048a43512ec1d650d87c8e76d2a0e7c5ceb114889d37b3ed259dc84", "ja": "それじゃ……今日はお先に失礼しますね。\nあ、聞いてくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "那么……今天我就先失陪了。\n啊，谢谢你愿意听我说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_525_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_01_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "64a388e4374f75e7e4a46a5c5d22a3460d4c50d03685c307e607a5e84eadf8b7", "ja": "明日も……、ううん、これからも、どこまでも！\nよろしくお願いしますね！　おやすみなさい！", "zh": "明天也……不对，今后也要一直走下去！\n请多多关照！晚安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
